OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum seekers to be moved from
OL,4,Ahotel in new year
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment plans to stop using a hotel
OL,7,Fto house asylum seekers in the new year
OL,8,Fhas been welcomed by a local council
OL,10,FWest Northamptonshire Council has been
OL,11,Ftold of plans to provide alternative
OL,12,Faccommodation for migrants in the west
OL,13,Fof the county by February next year.
OL,15,FMark Arnull, a Reform UK councillor who
OL,16,Fleads West Northamptonshire Council,
OL,17,Fsaid: "This announcement is
OL,18,Fencouraging, but I continue to call on
OL,19,Fthe Home Office to provide a clear
OL,20,Ftimetable and full transparency around
OL,21,Fits plans for the remaining sites in
OL,22,FWest Northamptonshire."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
